            <ArticleTitle>A stepwise guide to cancer pain management in the home.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>96-104; quiz 104-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients experiencing pain from cancer make up a large part of the caseload for most home care and hospice nurses. This article presents up-to-date information on the medications, strategies, and considerations in managing these patients. Helpful tables, reference points, and tips from a pain management expert are also presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
